Adapted for vLLM-Omni v0.32.0 (commit 5917730a):
- the patch.py hunk keeps the "--omni" argv gate, updated for upstream's
  list(sys.modules.items()) snapshot and setattr()-based rebinding;
- the npu_ar_model_runner.py / npu_generation_model_runner.py hunks that
  added num_scheduled_tokens_compressed_list are obsolete: upstream
  _prepare_inputs in v0.32.0 returns a 3-tuple again, so they were removed.

diff --git a/vllm_omni/patch.py b/vllm_omni/patch.py
index 687ff51..6b67924 100644
